    "notes": "Single session recorded May 8, 1961 at Plaza Sound Studios, New York. Original 1961 LP: tracks 1–6. Bonus tracks 7–8 (alternate takes of 'Kige's Tune') first issued on the 2007 Keepnews Collection CD remaster. Duration discrepancies exist across sources (e.g., Wikipedia vs. Discogs vs. AllMusic) but are minor. The trombonist is consistently identified as Dave Baker / David Baker; 'George Baker' from the task prompt is not source-supported."
